            "review_text": "Jarrod W\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam3 contributions\n0\nDecent food, good prices, poor service\nMar 2017 • Family\nFood was not bad. We had two lunch specials, reasonably priced at 180 / set. Wife enjoyed the chili. I had the galette which was a bit of a let down. Smoked salmon starter was good.\n\nProblem was that VAT not included in the price and it takes way too long to get the invoice (15 days). Also, they do not accept credit cards which is inconvenient.\nRead more\nWritten March 12, 2017\nLeBacoulos\nDear Jarrod,\n\nThanks for your review. Note that payment with credit card is now possible. Concerning VAT and red invoice, we are still working on making it faster. It should at least be lesser than 2 weeks now.\n\nAll the best.\nRead more\nWritten September 27, 2017\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
